TOKENOPT MONOREPO LICENSING

This repository follows an Open-Core Dual-Licensing model:

1. TokenOpt Enterprise Platform (tokenopt-proxy/):
   Licensed under the TokenOpt Enterprise Commercial Software License Agreement.
   Commercial / Paid software. Use in production or as an enterprise service requires
   a valid commercial license agreement, active paid subscription, or authorized
   production pilot agreement from TokenOpt.
   See tokenopt-proxy/LICENSE for full commercial terms.

2. TokenOpt Client SDK (tokenopt-sdk/):
   Licensed under the open-source MIT License.
   Free of charge for embedding into client applications (pip install tokenopt).
   See tokenopt-sdk/LICENSE for terms.

3. TokenOpt Optimizer Core (tokenopt-optimizer/):
   Licensed under the open-source MIT License.
   Free of charge for standalone embeddable prompt optimization.
   See tokenopt-optimizer/LICENSE for terms.
